 R←Test_SendEmail_56(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;other;port;cp;connection;rc;msg;log
⍝ Nobody listens on the port
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 other←⎕NEW FakeSMTPServer
 port←other.Start Conga
 other.Stop
 ⎕EX'other'
 cp←∆NewParms
 cp.Port←port
 connection←⎕NEW SMTP.Connection(,⊂cp)
 (rc msg log)←connection.Send ∆NewMail'Created by SMTP''s ',⊃⎕SI
 →T.PassesIf ¯1=rc
 →T.PassesIf'Conga error: '≡13↑msg

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
